  "story": {
    "day": 110,
    "title": "Kaya's Volunteer Circus Practice",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, a junior high school student, joined their volunteer club.",
      "Their idea was a small circus show for the elderly.",
      "The weather was good on the twelfth.",
      "Kaya practiced her skate act straight at the corner.",
      "She fell and got a small cut.",
      "\"Is something wrong?\" a member asked soon.",
      "Kaya hoped she would not be in the hospital.",
      "She took some medicine and felt the difference.",
      "The director sent a message: \"No problem. Our rule won't die.\"",
      "A police officer came out to report a lost number.",
      "The lost item was on the thirteenth floor. It did not belong there.",
      "\"Yeah, that small battle made me want my seat,\" Kaya thought."
    ]
  }
